WEBVTT

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:07.870
At present, the search for Mew Aqua continues.

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:10.230
The plan for the removal of humanity also advances.

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:11.070
Pie.

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:12.310
Yes.

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.870
What you are saying is that nothing has changed.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.860
My apologies.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:19.160
That’s fine.

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.620
I have new orders for you.

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:28.080
Destroy the Blue Knight.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:48.600
Destroy the Blue Knight...
What’s with Deep Blue-sama...?

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:53.990
I wonder what Deep Blue-sama is thinking.

00:00:55.370 --> 00:01:00.330
He’s just a guy who comes when he feels
like it. We don’t have to target him.

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:04.040
Certainly, his aim is not the protection of the Earth.

00:01:04.450 --> 00:01:06.120
So what you’re saying is...

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:11.000
...whether we attack him or not, it doesn’t
matter to Deep Blue-sama.

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:14.330
Pie, why?

00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:15.970
The reason isn’t important.

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:21.970
We are only following
Deep Blue-sama’s orders.

00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:23.480
Pie.

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:40.200
Certainly, there is no other possibility.

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:43.160
But, why?

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:45.580
How’s it going, Keiichirou?

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:47.870
Ryou, thanks.

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:54.550
I believe the series of phenomena
is due to the power of Mew Aqua.

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:59.750
Any other possibility is hard to fathom.

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:02.880
But there was no Mew Aqua.

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:04.010
Right.

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:09.850
There was not a single clear response.

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:12.890
Only a phenomenon occurred.

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:16.570
Even though there was no Mew Aqua?

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:20.990
There are too many uncertain elements, so...

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:26.580
Already, it may be an unattainable level for us.

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:27.540
Keiichirou?

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:31.170
Honestly, it’s too complicated.

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:34.040
Complicated...

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:44.210
Welcome.

00:02:44.210 --> 00:02:46.430
We’re welcomed!

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:49.900
Aoyama-san. Wonderful!

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:54.560
What is this? These customers are acting weird.

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:57.020
Surely, it’s due to Aoyama-san.

00:02:57.020 --> 00:02:58.990
There are too many customers!

00:02:59.940 --> 00:03:01.740
Have you decided on your order?

00:03:02.650 --> 00:03:04.030
Say it one more time.

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:05.450
Sure.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:07.240
“Have you decided on your order?”

00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:09.030
Handsome!

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:12.790
I wonder what Ichigo will think of this scene.

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:15.630
Oneesama, what do you mean?

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:20.430
Burning with jealousy, she might
chase out all the customers.

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:23.470
<i>No way! No way! No way!</i>

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:27.930
That is a possibility.

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:29.890
What should we do?

00:03:31.430 --> 00:03:33.650
Sorry, I’m late.

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:36.610
What’s this? My ribbon isn’t straight.

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:39.980
This seems to be good.
Thanks for waiting.

00:03:40.850 --> 00:03:42.610
Aoyama-kun, over here please!

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:43.610
Okay.

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:45.530
Aoyama-kun, I’ll have this!

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:48.990
Okay. Umm... One fruits parfait and...

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:50.780
Aoyama-kun!

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:51.500
Yes.

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:54.170
Aoyama-kun...

00:03:56.620 --> 00:03:57.950
Uh oh...

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:06.760
Aoyama-kun... He looks handsome as a waiter too!

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:11.350
What a relief.

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:14.270
Same as the customers.

00:04:15.470 --> 00:04:16.730
I’m sorry to have kept you waiting.

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:20.310
Ichigo, I was wondering if this is right.

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:21.990
Which one?

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:35.330
What is it, Shirogane?

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:40.600
Why are you staring like that?

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:43.340
Aoyama-kun finally joined us as a partner.

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:45.040
“Partner”?

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:48.470
That’s right. If not a partner,
what would you call him?

00:04:52.510 --> 00:04:56.190
Also, Shirogane, if you always act that rude,

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:58.310
you will never make any friends.

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:02.190
Geez...

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:09.030
I’m sorry about today.

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:10.610
About what?

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:14.740
Shirogane! That guy keeps to himself
and he’s not sociable and...

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:15.920
...he acts big.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:20.790
Ah, that scene before.
It’s okay. I don’t mind at all.

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:23.670
But he’s not a bad guy, really...

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:25.920
Just awkward.

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:28.220
Really, he’s a good guy.

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:29.760
Ichigo.

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:32.220
What?

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:37.150
You get along with Shirogane-san well.
I’m a bit jealous.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:41.810
I-It’s not like that at all! Only Aoyama-kun...

00:05:44.390 --> 00:05:46.110
Don’t worry about it.

00:05:49.190 --> 00:05:50.200
Ichigo.

00:05:51.070 --> 00:05:52.080
Let’s go.

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:23.930
Certainly, the Blue Knight’s action patterns
are to protect Mew Strawberry.

00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:27.490
No one else besides Mew Strawberry.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:37.000
Also, his appearance pattern is limited to
when Mew Strawberry has fallen into a crisis.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.250
So...

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:44.840
...if we attack this...

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:03.150
Strategy planning complete.

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:07.110
Fatality rate, 99.2%.

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:11.740
Blue Knight, your place of death has been decided.

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:31.330
The cook (593) is Shoutoku Taishi. Without
accident (645), the Taika reforms ended.

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:34.260
What (710) a magnificent Heijou Capital (Nara).

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:36.350
Aoyama-kun...!

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:56.230
Recently Ichigo has been acting weird.

00:07:56.230 --> 00:08:01.200
Well, she has been weird for a while, but lately she’s especially weird. Absolutely.

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:05.830
What? What is happening outside?

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:08.710
That’s...

00:08:19.050 --> 00:08:20.760
What is that?

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:22.140
Chimera Anima?

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:29.270
Ichigo!

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:31.270
Aoyama-kun!

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:31.780
Let’s hurry.

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:35.240
That’s the work of the aliens.

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:37.150
P-Probably.

00:08:37.150 --> 00:08:38.780
In that case...

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:40.200
Aoyama-kun.

00:08:40.900 --> 00:08:43.870
It’s okay because I’ll be there to protect you.

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:46.380
Right!

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:47.540
Then...

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:50.670
...let’s go!

00:09:01.590 --> 00:09:04.020
There is someone who protects me.

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:27.960
If I’m with Aoyama-kun,
I can overcome anything.

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:34.920
If I’m with Aoyama-kun, I absolutely
won’t let anything defeat me.

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:50.220
Weird Chimera Anima.

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:53.980
It moves as I planned. If so, we will definitely win...

00:09:54.510 --> 00:09:58.200
But with this dull animal, can we really win?

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:03.400
Don’t worry. With this plan, they
have no possibility of survival.

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:08.210
First objective, Blue Knight.

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:11.960
Second objective, Tokyo Mew Mew.

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:14.920
Starting now, annihilate them!

00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:16.510
Go!

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:23.100
Huge!

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:48.370
What is that?

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:06.520
Mew Mint! Mew Lettuce!

00:11:07.340 --> 00:11:10.520
You don’t have time to be lazy.

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:14.480
The enemy is large. Everyone, don’t let your guard down.

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:17.200
Mew Pomegranate! Pudding!

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:21.310
If we gather all of our power,
everything will be okay.

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:22.650
Let’s finish it quickly.

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:25.010
We can get back by lunch time.

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:25.950
Ichigo!

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:31.080
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:27.220
You came.

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:31.220
Pie, Tart. Stop acting like this.

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:33.930
No matter how many times, or whatever you do, it’s always the same.

00:12:33.930 --> 00:12:35.980
Isn’t it time to give up?

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:38.190
Watch out!

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:46.740
Reborn Pomegran’ Spear!

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:57.210
Aoyama-kun!

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:08.430
Reborn Mint Echo!

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:15.850
Reborn Lettuce Rush!

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:21.020
Reborn PuddingRings Inferno!

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:26.240
Now!

00:13:31.860 --> 00:13:32.780
What is this?

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:34.580
I can’t see anything.

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:41.510
Over there!

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:45.430
Reborn Strawberry...

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:51.970
Ichigo!

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:59.480
Can’t breathe.

00:14:10.940 --> 00:14:11.820
Ichigo...

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:12.870
Don’t move.

00:14:14.530 --> 00:14:16.200
It’s checkmate.

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:19.920
Look well.

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:28.800
If you resist at all,
Mew Strawberry will lose her life.

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:30.260
Ichigo.

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:40.430
You...

00:14:40.430 --> 00:14:42.020
Drop the sword.

00:14:44.140 --> 00:14:45.190
Drop it!

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:55.290
Acting conceited...

00:14:59.780 --> 00:15:02.330
Who are you looking at with those eyes?

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:12.890
Aoyama-kun!

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:21.600
If I only seize Mew Strawberry, Blue Knight, you’ll become a simple wooden doll.

00:15:22.510 --> 00:15:26.110
Now there is no possibility
of survival left.

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:32.240
Pathetic!

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:46.380
Aoyama-kun!

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:47.760
Stop it!

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:52.540
The Blue Knight, right...
He was fighting for you.

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:57.720
And since we caught you, no matter how strong he is, he can’t lift a hand against us.

00:15:58.300 --> 00:15:59.640
You...

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:04.470
Useless, useless! You old ladies
that can’t use your attacks,

00:16:04.470 --> 00:16:06.690
no matter how much you struggle,
you won’t get out.

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:20.700
Aoyama-kun! Run away! It doesn’t matter
what happens to me, so please!

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:23.170
Run away!

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:27.630
Ichigo...

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:44.470
Ichigo! Ichigo, I will...

00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:45.480
...protect you!

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:53.400
Because of me...

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:14.630
Aoyama-kun. Aoyama-kun!

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:39.280
Blue Knight, this is the end.

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.410
Hissatsu Hourai-kyuu!

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:07.760
Duty completed.

00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:09.480
Target terminated.

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:11.690
What?

00:18:17.230 --> 00:18:18.360
What is that?

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:21.780
Ichigo.

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:28.330
I’m sorry. Aoyama-kun.
To have gone through all of this...

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:31.630
I understand.

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:36.510
It’s not right to only be protected.

00:18:37.580 --> 00:18:38.590
Ichigo.

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:45.560
This time it’s my turn!

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:51.770
I will protect Aoyama-kun!

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:18.920
Reborn Strawberry Surprise!

00:19:27.070 --> 00:19:28.210
What is this?

00:19:28.210 --> 00:19:31.350
It can’t be true that Mew Strawberry had this enormous power.

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:34.020
It’s true. We can’t change it!

00:19:48.610 --> 00:19:51.270
This is Mew Strawberry’s power?

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:52.840
This much...

00:20:13.390 --> 00:20:18.150
Wrong. That power was not Ichigo’s.

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:19.820
That’s...

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:27.900
Of course, eating barbecue outdoors is the best!

00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:32.320
When Ichigo is with her boyfriend, wherever and whatever she eats is the best.

00:20:32.320 --> 00:20:34.780
Oh please, Minto.
You’re embarrassing me!

00:20:34.780 --> 00:20:36.290
I was just being sarcastic.

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:38.490
Aoyama-kun!

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:41.960
You can only smile like that for now.

00:20:42.830 --> 00:20:46.410
Next: “The Labyrinth of the Alternate
Dimension! Quiche’s Gamble!!”

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:52.630
I have nothing left after this.
Ichigo, I will give you a final chance.
